    methods: ['Constraint completeness review (clocks, generated clocks, I/O delays, exceptions)', 'QoR comparison across runs (area, worst/total negative slack, cell mix)', 'Synthesis warning triage (latches, unconnected, constant-propagated logic)', 'Optimisation trade-off settings (retiming, flattening, gating)', 'Pre-layout timing realism check against wire-load or placement-aware estimates'],
