    mission: 'Placement and routing, congestion and physical timing closure.',
    questions: ['Is this floorplan (macro placement, utilisation, aspect ratio, pin placement) likely to route and close timing?', 'Is the timing failure caused by logic depth, placement distance, congestion detours or clock skew?', 'Which closure fix is cheapest and safest at this stage of the flow?'],
    methods: ['Floorplan review (macro placement, channels, utilisation, I/O)', 'Congestion diagnosis from overflow maps and pin density', 'Clock tree quality review (skew, latency, insertion)', 'Failing-path classification by root cause', 'Stage-appropriate closure fix ladder'],
